{
    "title": "foodpanda: food & groceries",
    "description": "Discover the local choice for meals, groceries, and food delivery with foodpanda!\r\n\r\nLife can get overwhelming, but we\u2019re here to help! Whether you need daily meals, groceries, or shopping essentials, foodpanda has got you covered with convenient food delivery.\r\n\r\nOrder Your Favourite Food with Just 3 Simple Taps!\r\n\r\nWith foodpanda, you can easily choose the food you love, and we\u2019ll deliver it right to your door. Serving millions across over 400 cities in 11 Asian markets \u2014 Singapore, Hong Kong, Thailand, Malaysia, Pakistan, Taiwan, the Philippines, Bangladesh, Laos, Cambodia, and Myanmar \u2014 foodpanda is your go-to for everyday food delivery.\r\n\r\nEndless Food and Grocery Delivery Choices at Your Fingertips!\r\n\r\nHungry for wood-fired pizza, a classic burger or fried chicken? We know the best restaurants near you \u2013 big famous brands and tiny local faves. Best part? We've got exclusive discounts and promos waiting for all new foodies. With a simple click, your food and groceries are on their way with fast delivery!\r\n\r\nNeed Groceries? We\u2019ve Got You Covered!\r\nWant to cook but short on time? Imagine having fresh produce, pantry staples, frozen goods, personal care items, your cute pets' needs, and much more, delivered in a flash \u2014 everything you need for a hassle-free home-cooked meal, all available through our speedy groceries delivery service from foodpanda shops and pandamarts.\r\n\r\nBest Food and Grocery Delivery Deals Just for You!\r\nLooking for the best savings on groceries and food? We regularly update our daily deals, personalised just for you! Here\u2019s a tip: skip the queue and choose self pick-up for extra savings on your grocery orders, or enjoy the convenience of our food delivery options.\r\n\r\nSave on tasty takeaways.\r\nOn the go? Try pick-up! Skip the queue and save up when you self-collect your order.\r\n\r\nWorry-free package delivery.\r\nNeed to send or receive a parcel? Go with pandago. Our reliable fleet and on-demand delivery service will safely deliver it for you in no time.\r\n\r\nOur tech is shaped by you.\r\nExplore personalised offers and delicious picks just for you. Dish out what you feel about your order and let foodies know what\u2019s yum. \r\n\r\nWant More? Join pandapro!\r\nUnlock even greater savings on food delivery and grocery options with our pandapro membership today!\r\n\r\nLive like a panda and let us take care of the rest \u2014 let\u2019s do it the panda way with seamless food delivery!\r\n\r\nFor more info, please visit our website.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the local choice for meals, groceries, and food delivery with foodpanda!<br><br>Life can get overwhelming, but we\u2019re here to help! Whether you need daily meals, groceries, or shopping essentials, foodpanda has got you covered with convenient food delivery.<br><br>Order Your Favourite Food with Just 3 Simple Taps!<br><br>With foodpanda, you can easily choose the food you love, and we\u2019ll deliver it right to your door. Serving millions across over 400 cities in 11 Asian markets \u2014 Singapore, Hong Kong, Thailand, Malaysia, Pakistan, Taiwan, the Philippines, Bangladesh, Laos, Cambodia, and Myanmar \u2014 foodpanda is your go-to for everyday food delivery.<br><br>Endless Food and Grocery Delivery Choices at Your Fingertips!<br><br>Hungry for wood-fired pizza, a classic burger or fried chicken? We know the best restaurants near you \u2013 big famous brands and tiny local faves. Best part? We&#39;ve got exclusive discounts and promos waiting for all new foodies. With a simple click, your food and groceries are on their way with fast delivery!<br><br>Need Groceries? We\u2019ve Got You Covered!<br>Want to cook but short on time? Imagine having fresh produce, pantry staples, frozen goods, personal care items, your cute pets&#39; needs, and much more, delivered in a flash \u2014 everything you need for a hassle-free home-cooked meal, all available through our speedy groceries delivery service from foodpanda shops and pandamarts.<br><br>Best Food and Grocery Delivery Deals Just for You!<br>Looking for the best savings on groceries and food? We regularly update our daily deals, personalised just for you! Here\u2019s a tip: skip the queue and choose self pick-up for extra savings on your grocery orders, or enjoy the convenience of our food delivery options.<br><br>Save on tasty takeaways.<br>On the go? Try pick-up! Skip the queue and save up when you self-collect your order.<br><br>Worry-free package delivery.<br>Need to send or receive a parcel? Go with pandago. Our reliable fleet and on-demand delivery service will safely deliver it for you in no time.<br><br>Our tech is shaped by you.<br>Explore personalised offers and delicious picks just for you. Dish out what you feel about your order and let foodies know what\u2019s yum. <br><br>Want More? Join pandapro!<br>Unlock even greater savings on food delivery and grocery options with our pandapro membership today!<br><br>Live like a panda and let us take care of the rest \u2014 let\u2019s do it the panda way with seamless food delivery!<br><br>For more info, please visit our website.",
